\u7849\'3fm }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 ch\u7845\'3ft, hay kh\'f4ng h\u7907\'3fp th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu.. m\'e0 c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f kh\'f4ng c\'f3 k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3f
ch s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng trong n\'e3m k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f d\'f9ng cho n\'e3m sau(\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\'fd li\u7879\'3fu s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft trong c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr
\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft) ho\u7863\'3fc qu\'e1 2 n\'e3m kh\'f4ng ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc(\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\'e9 l\'e0m nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f l\'fdu th\'f4ng) \'f0\'fd
