\'3f gi\'e1 h\'e0ng \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7849\'3fy m\u7841\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fc chu chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn n\'e2ng cao hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f trong s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh.
\par 3/ Nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi h\'e0ng ho\'e1 k\'e9m ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 \u7913\'3f \'f0\u7885\'3fng l\'e2u ng\'e0y, h\'e0ng l\u7841\'3fc h\u7853\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi k\u7929
\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy \'f0inhj nh\'fd sau:
