\par b) M\u7913\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 h\'e0ng k\'e9m ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft, h\'e0ng l\u7841\'3fc h\u7853\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi t\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'fd\'f5ng v\u7899\'3fi m\u7913
\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh tr\'ean gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh c\u7911\'3fa v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd h\'e0ng ho\'e1 c}{
