\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 T\u7845\'3ft c\u7843\'3f v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 k\'e9m ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft, h\'e0ng l\u7841\'3fc h\u7853\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3f
t v\'e0 th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu, h\'e0ng \u7913\'3f \'f0\u7885\'3fng l\'e2u ng\'e0y... c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n cho nhau ho\u7863\'3fc cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f
 t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi theo \'f0\'fang h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\'fang m
\u7909\'3fc \'f0\'edch quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. Tuy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7921\'3f }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'fd nh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 
