\par Th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh h\u7841\'3f gi\'e1 h\'e0ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n c\u7845\'3fp nh\'fd sau:
\par B1- V\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 thu\u7897\'3fc danh m\u7909\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1:
\par + Nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh
\par - Gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 20% do H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng li\'ean ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc c\'f4ng ty \'f0\u7897\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp, li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, T\u7893\'3fng c
\'f4ng ty, c\'f4ng ty quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 nh.
