\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par - Gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 t\u7915\'3f 50% tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean do H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng li\'ean ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'f5 quan v\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0
