\par V\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 k\'e9m ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft, h\'e0ng l\u7841\'3fc h\u7853\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu, h\'e0ng \u7913\'3f \'f0\u7885\'3fng l\'e2u ng\'e0y... n\u7871\'3fu \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn cho ph\'e9p b\'e1n cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f th}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'ec gi\'e1 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 c\u7843\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\'fd sau:
\par - Gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 20% do H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng li\'ean ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'f3 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd quy
\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par - Gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 tr\'ean 20% do H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng li\'ean ng\'e0nh \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f, c\'f5 quan v\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 \'f0\'f3 quy
\u7871\'3ft }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af374 \ltrch\fcs0 \f374\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 B2- V\u7853\'3ft t\'fd h\'e0ng ho\'e1 ngo\'e0i danh m\u7909\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 do gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp,li\'ean hi
\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, T\u7893\'3fng c\'f4ng ty, c\'f4ng ty quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh theo s\u7921\'3f h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3f
c khu(n\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng) ho\u7863\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn(n\u7871\'3fu l\'e0 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f trung \'fd\'f5ng )
\par C- \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi h\'e0ng th\u7921\'3fc ph\u7849\'3fm t\'fd\'f5i s\u7889\'3fng b\u7883\'3f k\'e9m ho\u7863\'3fc m\u7845\'3ft ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'ec ph
\u7843\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi. M\u7913\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3f
i m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng n\'e0y do B\u7897\'3f ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn(\'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f trung \'fd\'f5ng ) v\'e0 u\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu \'f0\u7875
\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp. Trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa m}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'ecnh c\'e1 B\u7897\'3f, U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t
\u7881\'3fnh c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn cho c\'e1c }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc gi
\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 4/ X\u7917\'3f l\'fd v\u7873\'3f m\u7863\'3ft t\'e0i ch\'ednh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ph
\u7847\'3fn th\u7845\'3ft thu do gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 h\'e0ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7843\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 Ph\u7847\'3fn th\u7845\'3f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 t thu do gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi v\u7853
\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1 k\'e9m ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7845\'3ft, h\'e0ng l\u7841\'3fc h\u7853\'3fu so v\u7899\'3fi k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0 th\u7883\'3f hi\u7871\'3fu, h\'e0ng \u7913\'3f \'f0\u7885\'3fng ... \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f
 ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7921\'3f ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f m\u7863\'3ft t\'e0i ch\'ednh, kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc tr\u7915\'3f v\'e0o kho\u7843\'3fn n\u7897\'3fp ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc xin Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp v\u7889\'3fn}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642  b\u7893\'3f xung ph\u7847\'3fn th\u7845\'3ft thu n\'e0y
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft do nguy\'ean nh\'e2n kh\'e1ch quan (thi\'ean tai, \'f0\u7883\'3fch ph\'e1 ho\u7841\'3fi...) g\'e2y t\u7893\'3f
n th\u7845\'3ft n\u7863\'3fng n\u7873\'3f th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'ec h\u7897\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'f0\u7891\'3fng li\'ean ng\'e0
nh ki\u7871\'3fn ngh\u7883\'3f c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn xem x\'e9t quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y k}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 \'fd, nh\u7919\'3fng qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid1859054\charrsid9836642 y \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y c\u7911\'3fa U\u7927\'3f ban V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc , B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh tr\'e1i v\u7899\'3fi n\u7897\'3fi dung th\'f4ng t\'fd n
\'e0y \'f0\u7873\'3fu kh\'f4ng c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh.
\par Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f, t\u7893\'3fng c\u7909\'3fc, U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc trung \'fd\'f5ng ph\u7893\'3f bi\u7871
\'3fn th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\u7871\'3fn c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc. Cu\u7889\'3fi n\'e3m 1986 s\'f5 k\u7871\'3ft th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f b\u7893
\'3f sung, s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3fi ban h\'e0nh ch\'ednh th\u7913\'3fc.
